{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1443907-shorten-character-creation-to-15-minutes","id":1443907,"title":"Shorten Character Creation to 15 minutes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-14T11:59:27-07:00","id":1443907,"title":"Shorten Character Creation to 15 minutes","content":"How would you boil down character creation to make it faster? I am thinking of doing something like FATE where you fill out the essentials early and then players could fill in a roster of dots as they go.<br /> <br /> For example start with a clan, sect, concept, touchstone and loresheet and maybe a discipline. As play went on a player could add dots up to the maximum for regular character creation. Ie - My PC is a corrupt banker it would make sense he would have a high intelligence. Boom add some stats to mental, make a roll and keep going. <br /> <br /> Has anyone done something similar? Possibly starting out as mortals works well too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3901-radiofreedeath","name":"RadioFreeDeath","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-14T12:27:08-07:00","id":1443915,"title":"","content":"You could try using the classic system of freely assigning attribute/ability dots, and make up for xp imballance by charging flat rates for improving attributes/abilities. <br /> Skip loresheets. <br /> Reduce predator type to &quot;One free out of clan discipline&quot; or scrap it entirely. <br /> Make disadvantages optional in order to get a few more points for advantages. <br /> For disciplines, either get rid of the -one power per level- rule or have it so that you all get -all the powers of a level- or even pick a few powers and exclude the rest. V5 disciplines scare the shit out of me with overchoice and I spend far too long on them worrying i'll be missing out on X if i take Y. Streamlining the process is a must.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-16T07:16:15-07:00","id":1444201,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I second the pre-V5 approach for quick chargen. I can make a V20 character in less than 15 mins easily.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-16T13:49:05-07:00","id":1444257,"title":"","content":"Honestly just follow normal Character Gen up until you need to fill in Backstory and Convictions/Touchstones and you'll be done in like 15 minutes top once you come up with a character.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><div align=\"left\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/7.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26764-vilenecromancer","name":"Vilenecromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26764_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"247"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-16T14:07:31-07:00","id":1444260,"title":"","content":"It's already been massively streamlined. I do not see the need to streamline it further.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}